      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.tigase.org/&#34;&gt;Tigase&lt;/a&gt; is a Jabber server written in Java.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This presentation will go into the project goals and its current status. It will highlight the technical challenges encountered during development, while going over the server&amp;#39;s design.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Finally the future plans of the project and directions in the short term will be presented.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
